{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>出門時間明明記得清清楚楚，卻總在淋浴與穿鞋之間悄悄溜走。outtimer 只關注一件事：你必須離家的那一刻。它會以語音報出還剩多少分鐘，即使你正拿著牙刷、風筒或咖啡杯，也能掌握時間。程式原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，特別適合容易失去時間感或有 ADHD 的用家。</p>\n\n<h2>濕手也能聽到的語音倒數</h2>\n<p>設定好必須出門的時間，點一下開始即可。每 1 至 5 分鐘會聽到一次剩餘時間的語音提示，最後 10 分鐘改為每分鐘提醒，時間到便響鈴。螢幕關閉或已關閉 App 仍會繼續播報，提示期間只降低音樂音量，不會中斷播放。另備三種震動模式、鎖定畫面小工具、Live Activity 與動態島。程式無訂閱、無廣告、無帳號，只需通知權限。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-87-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-88-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-89-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-90-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-91-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-92-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：outtimer – On-Time Voice Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T17:19:29.225374+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":380,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}